mainIncludeError=The call of main.inc.php or master.inc.php in the file "%s" in module "%s" does not follow good practices. You must have at least (minimum) 2 tries to include the main.inc.php or master.inc.php file:<br>1 if module is inside the dolibarr root directory, and 1 to support when module is inside "the custom" directory. Best is to read the file modulebuilder/template/mymoduleindex.php for an example of sequence to load the main/master.inc.php. -> mainIncludeError=ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ main.inc.php ຫຼື master.inc.php ໃນໄຟລ໌ "%s" ໃນໂມດູນ "%s" ບໍ່ເປັນໄປຕາມແນວທາງທີ່ດີ. ທ່ານຕ້ອງມີການລອງຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 2 ຄັ້ງເພື່ອລວມໄຟລ໌ main.inc.php ຫຼື master.inc.php:<br>1 ຫາກໂມດູນຢູ່ໃນໂຟນເດີຮາກຂອງ dolibarr, ແລະ 1 ເພື່ອຮອງຮັບເມື່ອໂມດູນຢູ່ໃນໂຟນເດີ "custom". ວິທີທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນອ່ານໄຟລ໌ modulebuilder/template/mymoduleindex.php ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຕົວຢ່າງລຳດັບການໂຫຼດ main/master.inc.php.
directoryFound=But we found a directory or file with name: -> directoryFound=ແຕ່ພວກເຮົາພົບໂຟນເດີ ຫຼື ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຊື່ວ່າ:
docRootError=The call of your module class should not be done with DOL_DOCUMENT_ROOT, the file "%s" of module "%s" is wrong, you must correct the line below with "dol_include_once": -> docRootError=ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຄລາດໂມດູນຂອງທ່ານບໍ່ຄວນໃຊ້ DOL_DOCUMENT_ROOT, ໄຟລ໌ "%s" ຂອງໂມດູນ "%s" ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງແກ້ໄຂແຖບລຸ່ມນີ້ດ້ວຍ "dol_include_once":
dolIncludeError=The call of dol_include_once of the file "%s" in module "%s" is wrong, you must correct the line below: -> dolIncludeError=ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ dol_include_once ຂອງໄຟລ໌ "%s" ໃນໂມດູນ "%s" ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງແກ້ໄຂແຖບລຸ່ມນີ້:
moduleNameMismatch=Warning, the module file contains a directory in root called "%s" but this does not match the name of module used as file name that is "%s". -> moduleNameMismatch=ຄຳເຕືອນ, ໄຟລ໌ໂມດູນມີໂຟນເດີໃນຮາກທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ "%s" ແຕ່ມັນບໍ່ກົງກັບຊື່ຂອງໂມດູນທີ່ໃຊ້ເປັນຊື່ໄຟລ໌ເຊິ່ງແມ່ນ "%s".
rootDirWarning=Warning, a module file can contain only 1 root directory with the same name as the module (into the root of zip or into the htdocs directory). We found %s files/directories into the root of module. If this module is a meta-package (a module embedding several other modules), you must include a file metapackage.conf with list of all embedded module names in directory "%s" -> rootDirWarning=ຄຳເຕືອນ, ໄຟລ໌ໂມດູນສາມາດມີໂຟນເດີຮາກໄດ້ພຽງ 1 ໂຟນເດີທີ່ມີຊື່ດຽວກັບໂມດູນ (ໃນຮາກຂອງ zip ຫຼື ໃນໂຟນເດີ htdocs). ພວກເຮົາພົບ %s ໄຟລ໌/ໂຟນເດີ ໃນຮາກຂອງໂມດູນ. ຫາກໂມດູນນີ້ເປັນ meta-package (ໂມດູນທີ່ລວມຫຼາຍໂມດູນອື່ນໄວ້), ທ່ານຕ້ອງລວມໄຟລ໌ metapackage.conf ພ້ອມກັບລາຍຊື່ໂມດູນທັງໝົດທີ່ລວມຢູ່ນັ້ນໃນໂຟນເດີ "%s"
